## Description

Doing Executor's YC launch today!  Executor is your tool gateway - it gives you one place to sign in to all of the services you use and then every agent adopt (Hermes, Codex, OpenClaw, etc) carry over the same signed in accounts, permissions, etc  Executor gets a ton right about https://t.co/XJ519u7DLY

